Provenance of the AIC8800FC firmware
------------------------------------

`firmware/usb/aic8800DC/fmacfw_patch_8800dc_fc_u02.bin` (28124 bytes) and
`fmacfw_patch_tbl_8800dc_fc_u02.bin` (464 bytes) were extracted from the
AICSemi Windows driver `aicusbwifi.Sys` (win10_x64, 2025-01-13), where they
are the ROM patch and patch table that `rwnx_plat_patch_load_8800dc()` selects
for USB a69c:88dc at chip_sub_id 1. Both carry the vendor build stamp
`li Nov 25 2024 19:26:56 - g9fc3708`.

They are not interchangeable with the `fmacfw_patch_8800dc_u02.bin` /
`fmacfw_patch_tbl_8800dc_u02.bin` pair shipped for the Linux reference driver
(`zh May 28 2024 20:54:45 - g2db9716`): the two builds differ in size and in
the patch RAM description address, 0x00186e00 against 0x00187c00. Prefer an
official drop from AICSemi if one becomes available.
